{
  "an4.163:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.163 ",
  "an4.163:0.2": "17. Paṭipadāvagga ",
  "an4.163:0.3": "Asubhasutta ",
  "an4.163:1.1": "“Catasso imā, bhikkhave, paṭipadā. ",
  "an4.163:1.2": "Katamā catasso? ",
  "an4.163:1.3": "Dukkhā paṭipadā dandhābhiññā, ",
  "an4.163:1.4": "dukkhā paṭipadā khippābhiññā, ",
  "an4.163:1.5": "sukhā paṭipadā dandhābhiññā, ",
  "an4.163:1.6": "sukhā paṭipadā khippābhiññā. ",
  "an4.163:2.1": "Katamā ca, bhikkhave, dukkhā paṭipadā dandhābhiññā? ",
  "an4.163:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu asubhānupassī kāye viharati, āhāre paṭikūlasaññī, sabbaloke anabhiratisaññī, sabbasaṅkhāresu aniccānupassī; ",
  "an4.163:2.3": "maraṇasaññā kho panassa ajjhattaṁ sūpaṭṭhitā hoti. ",
  "an4.163:2.4": "So imāni pañca sekhabalāni upanissāya viharati—",
  "an4.163:2.5": "saddhābalaṁ, hiribalaṁ, ottappabalaṁ, vīriyabalaṁ, paññābalaṁ. ",
  "an4.163:2.6": "Tassimāni pañcindriyāni mudūni pātubhavanti—",
  "an4.163:2.7": "saddhindriyaṁ, vīriyindriyaṁ, satindriyaṁ, samādhindriyaṁ, paññindriyaṁ. ",
  "an4.163:2.8": "So imesaṁ pañcannaṁ indriyānaṁ muduttā dandhaṁ ānantariyaṁ pāpuṇāti āsavānaṁ khayāya. ",
  "an4.163:2.9": "Ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, dukkhā paṭipadā dandhābhiññā. ",
  "an4.163:3.1": "Katamā ca, bhikkhave, dukkhā paṭipadā khippābhiññā? ",
  "an4.163:3.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu asubhānupassī kāye viharati, āhāre pa�